+	/* Envoy: a reader that stops at a short read (see epoll_dispatch()) also
+	 * has to hear about urgent data, because a read stops at the urgent
+	 * mark with data left behind it. Urgent data is only asked for when
+	 * the fd is watched for read, write and early close at the same time,
+	 * so nothing changes for other events: every arrival of data wakes up
+	 * a waiter for EPOLLPRI, which a waiter for EPOLLIN gets anyway. */
